OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWhy London's dry ground will be
OL,4,Aslow to recover
OL,5,
OL,6,FSustained rainfall over a prolonged
OL,7,Fperiod will be needed for the ground to
OL,8,Ffully recover, experts say. Rob
OL,9,FHigginson, a geotechnical engineer,
OL,10,Fsays it will be a "very slow process"
OL,11,Fand that "a single downpour is not
OL,12,Fgoing to do it".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
